&lt;h3 id="language-as-zip"&gt;Language as zip&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Language is what happens when you &lt;strong&gt;zip&lt;/strong&gt; a whole mental universe into one thin line of text. Someone else unzips it with a different brain and never gets your exact state, only their reconstruction.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>